    "chunk_text": "wxl 2156$14 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 31 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'12'31\n\nNo. 2156/14 \u2013 TUESDAY, DECEMBER 31, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31736 - 34 (12/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT AS AMENDED BY LANDACQUISITION (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\n(CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: 3/2/bw;a/189.Land & Land Dev. Mini's Ref. No.: 4-3/4/2014/D/328.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for a public purpose: Acquisition of land for an accessroad to 5th Military Intelligence Corps of Sri Lanka Army.\n\nAn allotment of Land in total extent of 0.1685 Hec. depictedas Lots 01 and 02 in the Preliminary Plan No. fld 9849 preparedby the Surveyor General, situated in the village calledKaluaggala in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 436A ofSuduwella of Udugahapattuwa Minor Division in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Seethawaka (Hanwella) inColombo District of the Western Province and morefullydescribed as follows.\n\nLot No. 01Name of the Land: Unapandure Owita alias AttikkaghaOwita alias Unapandure Owita and Attikkagaha Owita atpresent Unapandure Waththa: Description: Home garden;Claimant: Kathriarachchige Don Fransis Lambert No. 120,Pahala Kaluaggala, Hanwella; Total Extent: 0.1663 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 02Name of the Land: Could not be traced: Description: Homegarden; Claimant: Could not be traced; Total Extent: 0.0022Hectare."
