    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.12.20191A\n\nwxl 2156$15 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 31 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2019'12'31No. 2156/15 - TUESDAY, DECEMBER 31, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nCONSTITUTION OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nNotice\n\nIT is hereby notified that by virtue of powers vested in me by Section 45(2) of the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I hereby delegate following duties and functions of the Ministry of Education to the StateMinister of Education Services.\n\nDULLAS ALAHAPPERUMA, Minister of Education.\n\nMinistry of Education,Isurupaya,Pelawatta,Battaramulla,31st December 2019.\n\n1A- G 31737\u2014 370 (12/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.12.20192A\n\n1. Organizing and implementingprograms in providing schooltext books, school uniforms,mid-day meals and othernecessities and facilities inconformity with the state policy.\n\n2. Promoting Buddhist and Palieducation and strengtheningPIRIVENA Education to achievethe objectives of Religiouseducation.\n\n3. Policy formulation, projects andprogram implementation inrelation to Tamil mediumschools and state schools as wellas monitoring and evaluating saidschools.\n\n4. Coordinating and supervisingstudent welfare, transport andsanitation of all provincialschools, private schools andinternational schools within aNational Policy Framework."
