    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2156$16 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 31 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'12'31No. 2156/16 - TUESDAY, DECEMBER 31, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4837\u2014 217 (12/2019)\n\nDirection No. 71\n\nCONSUMER AFFAIRS AUTHORITY ACT, No. 09 OF 2003\n\nDirection under Section 10(1)(a)\n\nACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 10(1)(a) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority directs all manufacturers, importers, distributors and traders that the following informationshall be legibly printed in Sinhala, Tamil and English lanaguages on all packs, containers or on the wrappers of all articles/goods specified in the Schedule hereto :\n\nMaximum Retail PriceBatch NumberDate of ExpiryDate of ManufacturerNet Weight/VolumeCountry of Origin/Country of manufacturerDate of Repacking (Products which are imported in bulk and repacked or products manufactured and packed in bulk andrepacked)\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1.Meat and Meat Products sold in Packs2.Fish and other Sea foods sold in Packs3.Tea leaves and Tea bags in packs4.Coffee seed and powder in packs5.Chocolates, Cooking Chocolates and Cocoa Powder\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.12.20192A"
